03","text":"后稷卒，子不窋立。不窋末年，夏后氏政衰，去稷不務，不窋以失其官而犇戎狄之間。不窋卒，子鞠立。鞠卒，子公劉立。公劉雖在戎狄之間，復修后稷之業，務耕種，行地宜，自漆、沮度渭，取材用，行者有資，居者有畜積，民賴其慶。百姓懷之，多徙而保歸焉。周道之興自此始，故詩人歌樂思其德。公劉卒，子慶節立，國於豳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"jqy_1fv_u7v","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"v6j_2xb_7i5","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"v6j_2xb_7i5","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"夏后氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"v6j_2xb_7i5","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"v6j_2xb_7i5","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"knr_imw_ifj","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"knr_imw_ifj","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"jqy_1fv_u7v","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0139","start":139,"end":14